  m_Name: Fishburn5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Question
  questionText: Do you have anything against the mayor?
  largeQuestionBox: 0
  conversation:
  - "...<i>oh.</i> Alright, I <i> see.</i>  Don\u2019t worry, we\u2019re still on
    the same page here."
  - "You\u2019ve gotta see if I\u2019ve got my own reasons for wanting to frame the
    guy, right? Gotta scrutinize everyone, no stones unturned. Even for good old
    Fishburn. I get it."
  - "Well to answer your suspicions, <i>no</i>. I\u2019ve got no reasons to want
    Bunyon under the bus."
  - Hm.
  - <i>...Hmmm...</i>
  - "Alright, I\u2019ll level with you. You\u2019re losing me a little here. Think
    you might be floundering a bit."
  - I mean...
  - "I don\u2019t even go to the East District, so there\u2019s no reason for me
    to be opposed to its development in the first place."
  - '[MASK SHATTERS]'
  - "<i>AND WE\u2019RE BACK.</i>"
  - Yes! <i>YEEES!</i>
  - That tracks. That <i>absolutely</i> tracks.
  - Perfectly apt deduction, but not the <i>entire</i> story.
  - "So for your display of wits I\u2019ll offer you this:"
  - "While I <i>have</i> been involved in mild matters of nefarious deedery relating
    to this matter, it\u2019s not quite what you think."
  - "So I\u2019ll tell you <i>this,</i> and do with it as you will."
  - "The body on the powerlines didn\u2019t cause the power outage. <color=notiCol><i>I</i>
    did.</color>"
  - I snuck into the power station and turned it off at 11pm so I could go stargazing
    above the East District.
  - "See, that\u2019s my favourite spot, because that\u2019s where the stars gaze
    <i>back.</i>"
  - "But, <i>as I\u2019m sure you\u2019ve already pieced together, as have I,</i>
    that means that the murder has to have taken place <i>before</i> then."
  - So do with <i>that</i> as you will.
  - "I don\u2019t like Bunyon but I\u2019d never wanna frame him for a murder he
    didn\u2019t do."
  - "...oh and I wouldn\u2019t kill someone for no reason. And I haven\u2019t had
    a reason to kill someone ...since..."
  - ...The Jungle...
  - "<b>[Fishburn takes a seat and looks off into the distance. He seems to be looking
    at something that you can\u2019t quite see.]</b>"
